{
  "_comment": [
    "Seed fixture for the service-health-htmx widget-type bead.",
    "Created for ka-0000006096 (Phase 4 free-htmx port — tenth port after",
    "activity-log-htmx (MR !2334 / ka-0000004584), related-tickets-htmx",
    "(MR !2346 / ka-0000005540), header-incident-summary-htmx (MR !2347 /",
    "ka-0000005304), reproduction-steps-htmx (ka-0000007835),",
    "reporter-info-htmx (ka-0000004065), event-timeline-htmx",
    "(ka-0000000243), ai-recommended-actions-htmx (ka-0000000272),",
    "fix-available-pending-branch-htmx (ka-0000005506), and",
    "vm-sparklines-htmx (ka-0000000715)). Strategy A — port-then-soak:",
    "lives alongside the Go-coded `service-health` slug",
    "(widgets_phase4.go::renderServiceHealth) rather than replacing it.",
    "Authoring path:",
    "",
    "  kd create 'Free-htmx widget: service-health-htmx' \\",
    "    --type=widget-type \\",
    "    -F gardenio/controller/cmd/beads-viewer/fixtures/service-health-htmx.json",
    "",
    "Pre-write hooks (kbeads/internal/server/widget_validation.go) parse",
    "template_source under html/template and reject malformed inputs at",
    "createBead/updateBead time, so a bad fixture surfaces immediately.",
    "Schema validation runs against widget-instance writes per the same",
    "pre-write hook; the schema below is the wire contract.",
    "",
    "The wire contract mirrors the Go-coded `service-health` renderer at",
    "widgets_phase4.go::renderServiceHealth — flat services[] with",
    "service/state/detail. One intentional parity gap documented in",
    "TestServiceHealthParity and the port doc:",
    "  1. State sanitization — Go path lowercases the state via",
    "     strings.ToLower; htmx template emits state verbatim. Producers",
    "     should pre-lower to one of healthy/warn/critical to match the",
    "     [data-state] CSS targets."
  ],
  "fields": {
    "slug": "service-health-htmx",
    "widget_version": "1",
    "renderer_kind": "htmx",
    "template_engine": "go-html-template-v1",
    "schema": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "services": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "service": {"type": "string"},
              "state":   {"type": "string"},
              "detail":  {"type": "string"}
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "template_source": "<div class=\"ii-w-services\" data-ii-crossfilter-group=\"service-health\">\n{{- $services := index .Payload \"services\" -}}\n{{if $services}}\n  <table class=\"ii-w-table\">\n    <thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>State</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n      {{range $services}}\n        <tr data-ii-crossfilter-keys=\"service\" data-ii-crossfilter-service=\"{{.service}}\">\n          <td><code>{{.service}}</code></td>\n          <td>{{if .state}}<span class=\"ii-pill\" data-state=\"{{.state}}\">{{.state}}</span>{{else}}—{{end}}</td>\n          <td>{{.detail}}</td>\n        </tr>\n      {{end}}\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n{{else}}\n  <p class=\"empty\">No service rows.</p>\n{{end}}\n</div>",
    "sample_payload": {
      "services": [
        {"service": "study-web",   "state": "critical", "detail": "5xx 12% (last 5m)"},
        {"service": "sponsor-api", "state": "warn",     "detail": "latency p95 1.2s"},
        {"service": "site-api",    "state": "healthy",  "detail": "5xx 0%"}
      ]
    }
  }
}
